      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OZZIE TART (5) started a hot favourite last start but jumped a shadow and broke. Nice effort for fifth in the Vicbred Super Series 3F Final prior. She can win if on her best behaviour. MELICAN (3) hasn't raced since kicking off her career with an impressive win at Hobart in July but has been readied with two trial wins and has the benefit of a good draw. In a new yard and could make an immediate impact on the mainland. FOUR EVER A STAR (1) produced another good effort last time out when third at this venue. Gets the inside draw so should run a big race. EAGLEYE (6) has been solid in two outings for Alex Ashwood, last time coming from a similar draw for second at Melton.",
